    "This page brings together official summit announcements and useful context on Kenya-China tea trade, value addition, investment and technology.": "本页面汇集了峰会官方公告以及关于肯尼亚—中国茶叶贸易、增值、投资和技术的有用背景信息。",
    "Summit updates": "峰会动态",
    "<span class=\"class-row__code\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-23\">23 August 2026</time></span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\"><a href=\"/news/what-chinese-buyers-look-for/\">What Chinese buyers look for in African tea</a></span>\n    <p>Orthodox against CTC, leaf grades, packaging and traceability expectations, and where Kenyan supply currently meets them.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__code\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-23\">2026年8月23日</time></span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\"><a href=\"/news/what-chinese-buyers-look-for/\">中国买家在非洲茶叶中寻找什么</a></span>\n    <p>正山茶与CTC茶的对比、茶叶等级、包装和可追溯性期望,以及肯尼亚供应目前在哪些方面满足这些要求。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__code\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-22\">22 August 2026</time></span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\"><a href=\"/news/registration-open/\">Registration is open. Here is what follows.</a></span>\n    <p>What registering does, what the delegate portal will do, when stand booking opens, and the timetable for fees, speakers and the full programme.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__code\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-22\">2026年8月22日</time></span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\"><a href=\"/news/registration-open/\">登记现已开放。以下是后续安排。</a></span>\n    <p>登记的作用、代表门户网站的功能、展位预订何时开放,以及费用、演讲嘉宾和完整议程的时间表。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__code\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-20\">20 August 2026</time></span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\"><a href=\"/news/summit-venue-kicc/\">Why the summit is at KICC, and why the expo is in a tent</a></span>\n    <p>What the Kenyatta International Convention Centre offers a trade delegation, why 146 stands go up on the grounds rather than inside, and what exhibitors should expect.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__code\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-20\">2026年8月20日</time></span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\"><a href=\"/news/summit-venue-kicc/\">峰会为何在KICC举行,博览会为何在帐篷中进行</a></span>\n    <p>Kenyatta International Convention Centre为贸易代表团提供什么,为何146个展位搭建在场地上而非室内,以及参展商应有何期待。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__code\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-18\">18 August 2026</time></span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\"><a href=\"/news/kenya-tea-exports-2025/\">Kenya&#39;s tea exports grew 10 per cent in 2025. China took two per cent of them.</a></span>\n    <p>The Tea Board of Kenya&#39;s 2025 figures in plain terms, and why selling a great deal to very few buyers is a weaker position than it looks.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__code\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-18\">2026年8月18日</time></span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\"><a href=\"/news/kenya-tea-exports-2025/\">肯尼亚2025年茶叶出口增长10%。中国占其中2%。</a></span>\n    <p>Tea Board of Kenya的2025年数据简明解读,以及为何向极少数买家销售大量茶叶的地位比表面看起来更为薄弱。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__code\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-03\">3 August 2026</time></span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\"><a href=\"/news/kenya-china-tea-why-now/\">Why the Kenya-China tea conversation matters now</a></span>\n    <p>Zero tariffs cut one barrier to the Chinese market. Kenya&#39;s first-quarter shipments to China still fell. What sits between access and demand.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__code\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-03\">2026年8月3日</time></span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\"><a href=\"/news/kenya-china-tea-why-now/\">为何肯尼亚—中国茶叶对话此刻至关重要</a></span>\n    <p>零关税消除了进入中国市场的一个障碍。肯尼亚第一季度对中国的出货量仍然下降。市场准入与需求之间存在什么阻碍。</p>",
